  <item>
    <title>19 年前混乱、AI升温、多邻国上瘾：失序中的控制感｜2月声音日记1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699179f266e2c3037784e795</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699179f266e2c3037784e795</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到全新栏目#声音日记#的第五期。蛇年最后一期，2月生活碎碎念。也提前祝大家新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🎙️浅浅陪伴一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：媒体人 赛文（RED@</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/1PT19tAjcVT" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/1PT19tAjcVT"><span>男香小姐</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【📻浅浅介绍一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span>CUT1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> 现担人的普遍困境；无法真正休息、享受闲暇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 为什么这个年前如此兵荒马乱：“临危受命”接了一个救火项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 喜忧参半的38项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">11:24</a> 广告是否是碗青春饭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> girls understand girls</span></p><span></span><p><span>CUT2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> 和AI爱恨情仇的后续：陷入爱情的迷妹，如胶似漆、越来越懂我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> 一个情绪稳定、快速响应、24小时standy的战友，很难不爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 很怕AI在无下限地讨好我！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a> 终于get了养成系的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> 但是和真人的交流依然很重要！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> AI也有自由意志吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>CUT3</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a> 终于入坑多邻国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 多邻过让人上瘾的点到底是啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 多邻国可能是失序是生活里我唯一能确认的掌控感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 隐隐约约觉得哪里不太对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2514">41:54</a> 享受纯粹学习的乐趣，还是需要设置一个明确的目标？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【📍浅浅安利一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢这档播客，欢迎在评论区留言互动，也欢迎将节目分享给你的朋友，这将是莫大的鼓励和帮助（笔芯！</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友反馈：zhuanglijun323@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
