  <item>
    <title>18 过一种“随时和随手”的生活｜1月声音日记一</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696e01ebef1cf272a73bb798</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696e01ebef1cf272a73bb798</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到全新栏目</span><strong><span>#声音日记#</span></strong><span>的第四期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，和大家分享两个新体悟：拍VLog这件小事以及“随手”的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🎙️浅浅陪伴一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：媒体人 赛文（RED@</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/1PT19tAjcVT" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/1PT19tAjcVT"><span>男香小姐</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【📻浅浅介绍一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span>CUT1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 新年第一个变化：开始拍Vlog啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 为什么过去迟迟不敢开始尝试？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a> 充剪映会员的钱，push我半推半就迈出了第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 拍什么？普通人的生活值得被看吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> 但是，趁着还在上头先做再说吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 感受一：相比声音，影像的“侵入感”、“异物感”和“存在感”确实都更强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 感受二：人还是得在工作之外找点需要花整块时间干的事儿，严丝合缝的爽感，谁懂？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 感受三：原来高能量真的具有很强的感染力！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 感受四：人远比自己想象的更能干</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> “听从内心的声音”，原来是很美妙的一句话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 顺便推荐一个“解放内存”的好物：手机外接U盘</span></p><span></span><p><span>CUT2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 土豆与家务的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">27:07</a> 那张长满杂物的桌面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a> 那些随手脱下来的衣服“小山包”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 灵药：养成“随手物归原位”+“顺手做了”的习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">33:19</a> “好学生”长大之后</span></p><span></span><p><span>【📍浅浅安利一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢这档播客，欢迎在评论区留言互动，也欢迎将节目分享给你的朋友，这将是莫大的鼓励和帮助（笔芯！</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友反馈：zhuanglijun323@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
