    <title>17 大理游：在无处可逃的商业里，寻片刻自在</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6953725014db1df9ef7de5cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6953725014db1df9ef7de5cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 07:03:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前段时间休假，去了云南，主要是大理和普洱两个城市。这一期，是大理段的“声音游记”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会听到两部分：一部分是我在旅行途中录下的“现场声”，颇为沉浸（零散），另一部分是回来后在家补录的。两个部分互相交叉、串联，是一种比较特别但可能还是有些混乱的体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>此处要感谢《基本无害Mostly Harmless》毛冬老师某一期的启发：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693ff9c42a383da1673e2b81" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693ff9c42a383da1673e2b81"><span>《格鲁吉亚攻略，蚋出没注意，古风夜生活》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【🎙️浅浅陪伴一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：媒体人 赛文（RED</span><a href=" https://xhslink.com/m/7w7blKfmDJO" data-url=" https://xhslink.com/m/7w7blKfmDJO"><span>@男香小姐</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【📻浅浅介绍一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> 感谢毛冬老师，播客录制思路打开！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> why云南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> day1：大理初体验-好晒，好冷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 酒店大大满意（详情可参考</span><a href="http://xhslink.com/o/AbMYtuP3r9h" data-url="http://xhslink.com/o/AbMYtuP3r9h"><span>这条笔记</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> day2：古镇/古城，略失望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> day3: 苍山12公里徒步+三塔崇圣寺，好评！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2316">38:36</a> day4：无处不在的商业，让人厌烦，不如再次凭直觉行事</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><p><span>【📍浅浅安利一个】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢这档播客，欢迎在评论区留言互动，也欢迎将节目分享给你的朋友，这将是莫大的鼓励和帮助（笔芯！</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友反馈：zhuanglijun323@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
